WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.370
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.640 --> 01:42.890
[Spring of The Blade]

3
01:43.340 --> 01:45.990
[Episode 19]

4
01:55.220 --> 01:57.830
Xia Yingying left me two things.

5
01:59.870 --> 02:01.330
The first is this hairpin.

6
02:03.350 --> 02:04.680
The other is Qingrong.

7
02:05.430 --> 02:07.200
After Xia Yingying passed away,

8
02:07.200 --> 02:08.259
I was soft-hearted

9
02:09.710 --> 02:10.910
and brought her back.

10
02:11.960 --> 02:13.800
I raised her day and night.

11
02:15.400 --> 02:16.960
We developed a bond,

12
02:18.380 --> 02:19.970
and also an obsession.

13
02:22.240 --> 02:23.430
In my heart,

14
02:25.000 --> 02:26.630
Qingrong and Qingru

15
02:27.310 --> 02:29.310
are both my own flesh and blood.

16
02:30.400 --> 02:31.730
There is no difference.

17
02:32.910 --> 02:34.560
You are so kind, Madam.

18
02:40.280 --> 02:42.470
Maybe this is retribution.

19
02:47.000 --> 02:48.130
I just hope Qingrong

20
02:50.150 --> 02:52.120
will never know the truth.

21
03:09.940 --> 03:12.990
[Harmony Among Kin]

22
03:17.120 --> 03:17.910
You're here.

23
03:18.400 --> 03:20.360
Third Sister, you're burning the Rebirth Sutra

24
03:20.360 --> 03:21.750
for Fifth Madam again.

25
03:22.030 --> 03:24.360
Fortunately, the truth has come to light,

26
03:24.680 --> 03:25.960
allowing the two of us

27
03:26.150 --> 03:27.680
to peacefully coexist.

28
03:28.190 --> 03:30.920
Previously, I saw you as the daughter of my enemy,

29
03:32.590 --> 03:35.390
but I didn't expect to have hated the wrong person.

30
03:36.280 --> 03:37.480
If it weren't for you,

31
03:38.360 --> 03:41.090
the real culprit who killed my mother and brother

32
03:41.400 --> 03:43.660
would probably still be gloating today.

33
03:43.710 --> 03:44.400
But I...

34
03:49.120 --> 03:50.400
Like you,

35
03:51.560 --> 03:53.220
I lost my mother at a young age.

36
03:53.710 --> 03:55.400
Therefore, in this residence,

37
03:55.400 --> 03:57.120
the person who understands you best

38
03:57.120 --> 03:57.850
should be me.

39
03:59.430 --> 04:00.760
As your mother's child,

40
04:01.630 --> 04:03.120
if you live under the same roof as your enemy

41
04:03.120 --> 04:05.310
and remain indifferent,

42
04:06.430 --> 04:08.160
that'd make you truly unfilial

43
04:08.870 --> 04:09.730
and heartless.

44
04:12.430 --> 04:13.230
Third Sister,

45
04:13.800 --> 04:14.800
I don't blame you,

46
04:15.280 --> 04:17.010
and you shouldn't mind either.

47
04:17.480 --> 04:18.720
I don't mind at all.

48
04:23.630 --> 04:24.040
Yes,

49
04:24.920 --> 04:26.190
I did hate you before

50
04:27.040 --> 04:29.070
and always made things difficult for you.

51
04:29.070 --> 04:30.730
But you didn't suffer either.

52
04:30.800 --> 04:32.600
Anyway, every time I teased you,

53
04:32.680 --> 04:34.540
I was the one who ended up unlucky.

54
04:41.480 --> 04:42.360
Qingyuan,

55
04:45.870 --> 04:46.470
I'm sorry.

56
04:49.190 --> 04:50.450
And thank you, really.

57
04:58.630 --> 04:59.630
Mei Yinghua

58
05:00.150 --> 05:02.480
received a heavy punishment from Father.

59
05:02.800 --> 05:04.830
If Fifth Madam knew this in the afterlife,

60
05:04.830 --> 05:06.160
she could rest in peace.

61
05:09.360 --> 05:11.690
But there's one thing I don't understand.

62
05:11.690 --> 05:14.130
[Harmony Among Kin]

63
05:11.830 --> 05:14.600
Concubine Mei is not proficient in pharmacology,

64
05:14.600 --> 05:17.730
so how could she come up with such a subtle poison scheme?

65
05:23.720 --> 05:25.180
Or is it really as she said,

66
05:25.800 --> 05:27.390
she only wanted Fifth Madam to miscarry

67
05:27.390 --> 05:28.990
and had no intention to kill?

68
05:30.750 --> 05:32.680
That cruel woman bullied my mother

69
05:33.920 --> 05:36.040
and managed internal affairs for years.

70
05:36.040 --> 05:38.240
Naturally, she had no good intentions.

71
05:38.270 --> 05:39.310
Since childhood,

72
05:39.750 --> 05:41.480
you grew up under Mother's roof

73
05:41.870 --> 05:43.310
with Second Sister.

74
05:43.800 --> 05:46.270
You always disregarded others.

75
05:47.310 --> 05:48.570
As such, you might have

76
05:49.400 --> 05:51.430
overlooked certain things.

77
05:55.190 --> 05:57.320
You've just recently discovered that

78
05:57.830 --> 06:00.060
the real murderer is not my mother,

79
06:00.310 --> 06:01.360
but Mei Yinghua.

80
06:04.480 --> 06:05.430
The Xie family

81
06:06.800 --> 06:08.330
hides far too many secrets.

82
06:09.190 --> 06:10.120
What you hear

83
06:10.830 --> 06:11.600
and see

84
06:12.310 --> 06:13.970
is not necessarily the truth.

85
06:14.430 --> 06:16.430
Even though Mei Yinghua is vicious,

86
06:16.630 --> 06:17.680
she knew

87
06:18.040 --> 06:19.510
she couldn't escape her crimes.

88
06:19.510 --> 06:21.570
So why did she bite back for no reason?

89
06:23.070 --> 06:24.800
Why isn't anyone accusing her?

90
06:25.920 --> 06:27.840
A-Are you out of your mind?

91
06:27.860 --> 06:29.750
You told me about the euphorbia!

92
06:33.430 --> 06:34.960
Though I no longer hate you,

93
06:35.430 --> 06:37.690
I don't need to hear you say these things.

94
06:41.680 --> 06:43.190
I've been in the residence for a long time.

95
06:43.190 --> 06:44.790
If there's really anything,

96
06:45.750 --> 06:46.560
I'd know.

97
07:03.310 --> 07:03.950
Lord Xie.

98
07:04.830 --> 07:06.760
Having just lost your beloved son,

99
07:07.360 --> 07:09.960
you still insist on stepping up to take charge.

100
07:10.560 --> 07:12.680
I admire you.

101
07:17.870 --> 07:20.190
I will substitute tea for wine

102
07:21.000 --> 07:22.260
to toast you, Lord Xie.

103
07:22.600 --> 07:24.170
-To Lord Xie. -To Lord Xie.

104
07:45.120 --> 07:47.460
My trivial family matters

105
07:47.950 --> 07:51.070
have troubled you, my lords.

106
07:53.430 --> 07:54.390
Thank you.

107
07:57.310 --> 07:58.310
Please.

108
07:58.870 --> 07:59.800
Please, my lord.

109
08:07.800 --> 08:09.850
Yan Rui has left.

110
08:10.720 --> 08:12.450
It is settled that Wei Changyan

111
08:13.270 --> 08:15.350
colluded with

112
08:15.750 --> 08:17.010
the northern bandits.

113
08:17.600 --> 08:19.040
I would like to hear

114
08:19.600 --> 08:21.190
what your next steps

115
08:21.920 --> 08:23.310
will be.

116
08:25.680 --> 08:28.270
Yan Rui is finally cleared out of Hengtang.

117
08:28.680 --> 08:31.510
Wei Changyan left behind a huge mess of unresolved accounts.

118
08:31.510 --> 08:35.600
We still need you to make decisions, Lord Xie.

119
08:36.240 --> 08:37.030
Not so.

120
08:38.630 --> 08:39.320
Not so.

121
08:40.120 --> 08:44.010
Hengtang belongs to all of you,

122
08:44.150 --> 08:46.480
not just me.

123
08:47.080 --> 08:48.240
In all matters,

124
08:48.510 --> 08:51.600
we must join forces

125
08:51.910 --> 08:54.240
and deliberate together.

126
08:55.480 --> 08:56.600
-Yes. -Yes.

127
09:01.000 --> 09:01.870
In my opinion,

128
09:02.200 --> 09:03.930
we should follow the old rules.

129
09:04.390 --> 09:06.390
The more you work, the more you gain.

130
09:07.440 --> 09:08.440
What do you think?

131
09:08.910 --> 09:09.720
Good.

132
09:09.720 --> 09:11.050
Your Lordship is right.

133
09:11.510 --> 09:12.910
Your Lordship is right.

134
09:13.870 --> 09:14.630
Lord Xie,

135
09:14.630 --> 09:15.790
with you in charge,

136
09:15.790 --> 09:17.960
we naturally have no objections.

137
09:17.960 --> 09:18.630
Right, my lords?

138
09:18.630 --> 09:19.720
That's right.

139
09:19.720 --> 09:21.000
No objections at all.

140
09:21.790 --> 09:22.480
Lord Xie,

141
09:23.030 --> 09:26.660
Wei Changyan left a sum of money at the dock.

142
09:26.870 --> 09:28.240
Counting it

143
09:28.390 --> 09:30.120
will take some effort.

144
09:30.600 --> 09:33.270
I am willing to share your burden, Lord Xie.

145
09:33.390 --> 09:35.460
Lord Xie, I'm also free lately.

146
09:35.600 --> 09:37.670
I'm willing to help settle Wei Changyan's old accounts too

147
09:37.670 --> 09:39.120
and share your burden, Lord Xie.

148
09:39.120 --> 09:40.090
I'm free too.

149
09:40.110 --> 09:40.750
I'm free too.

150
09:40.750 --> 09:43.550
We are also willing to share your burden, Lord Xie.

151
09:47.150 --> 09:47.790
Whose people are they?

152
09:47.790 --> 09:48.600
This...

153
09:50.030 --> 09:50.600
This...

154
09:51.030 --> 09:52.670
Death is at your door,

155
09:52.670 --> 09:54.790
yet you are still fighting over a few pieces of silver.

156
09:54.790 --> 09:55.390
This is...

157
09:55.790 --> 09:56.630
Lord Xie,

158
09:57.010 --> 09:59.220
[Yongjia County Lady, Pei Yuting]

159
09:57.150 --> 09:59.750
you really know how to lead your subordinates.

160
10:00.150 --> 10:00.880
How dare you?

161
10:01.030 --> 10:02.000
Who are you?

162
10:02.440 --> 10:04.360
My lords are discussing important matters here.

163
10:04.360 --> 10:06.220
How can a woman like you come here?

164
10:06.240 --> 10:06.670
Guards!

165
10:06.670 --> 10:07.360
Wait!

166
10:08.150 --> 10:10.240
If I'm not mistaken,

167
10:11.030 --> 10:12.150
could you be

168
10:12.390 --> 10:14.240
the adopted daughter of the Imperial Noble Consort,

169
10:14.240 --> 10:15.550
sister of Pei Liangyong,

170
10:15.550 --> 10:16.750
Yongjia County Lady?

171
10:16.790 --> 10:17.600
County Lady?

172
10:18.320 --> 10:19.750
Greetings, My Lady.

173
10:24.790 --> 10:27.390
I, Pei Yuting, haven't been in Hengtang for a long time,

174
10:27.390 --> 10:28.850
but you still remember me.

175
10:29.200 --> 10:29.960
It seems

176
10:30.440 --> 10:32.240
you are not completely foolish.

177
10:32.720 --> 10:34.080
We wouldn't dare.

178
10:34.960 --> 10:37.320
Founding Countess

179
10:37.960 --> 10:40.220
was involved in disaster relief efforts

180
10:40.480 --> 10:41.870
and met with an accident.

181
10:41.870 --> 10:44.840
I was deeply saddened.

182
10:45.870 --> 10:48.670
Are you here regarding that matter?

183
10:49.030 --> 10:51.870
I missed seeing off my brother and sister-in-law.

184
10:52.000 --> 10:52.790
But,

185
10:53.100 --> 10:55.410
I'm just in time to see you all off.

186
10:56.690 --> 10:57.910
See us off?

187
10:57.910 --> 10:58.510
No...

188
10:59.390 --> 11:00.600
What do you mean?

189
11:02.200 --> 11:05.270
I heard that with Lord Xie in Hengtang,

190
11:05.870 --> 11:08.530
our Pei family will always be at a disadvantage.

191
11:09.120 --> 11:10.330
If today,

192
11:10.790 --> 11:12.750
Lord Xie is willing to beg me

193
11:13.320 --> 11:14.320
and make me happy,

194
11:14.910 --> 11:17.170
I might be willing to tell you something.

195
11:21.670 --> 11:22.960
Please enlighten me.

196
11:24.080 --> 11:26.870
The fake Yan Rui you let slip

197
11:27.200 --> 11:30.620
is actually a favored minister of His Majesty,

198
11:30.840 --> 11:32.000
Shen Run.

199
11:34.910 --> 11:37.870
Even the Prince has to treat him with respect.

200
11:37.900 --> 11:40.160
Do you know what's even more terrifying?

201
11:40.360 --> 11:42.630
His father was Shen Zhibai.

202
11:44.320 --> 11:44.790
This...

203
11:45.080 --> 11:47.600
Now he has requested an edict to return to Hengtang.

204
11:47.600 --> 11:48.480
Tell me,

205
11:48.870 --> 11:49.840
if he met the lot of you

206
11:49.840 --> 11:52.440
who framed his father,

207
11:52.670 --> 11:53.440
now that he is back,

208
11:53.440 --> 11:55.120
how would he deal with you?

209
11:57.360 --> 11:58.480
This... I...

210
11:58.480 --> 12:00.280
Especially you, the Xie family.

211
12:01.000 --> 12:02.540
Falling into his hands

212
12:02.720 --> 12:04.150
is only a matter of time.

213
12:06.360 --> 12:06.870
This...

214
12:07.000 --> 12:09.130
How can I ensure my family's survival?

215
12:09.240 --> 12:09.960
We're doomed.

216
12:09.960 --> 12:10.840
A fake Yan Rui left,

217
12:10.840 --> 12:12.240
and a real king of hell is coming.

218
12:12.240 --> 12:13.360
What do we do now?

219
12:13.360 --> 12:14.160
That's right.

220
12:14.550 --> 12:15.150
Lord Xie.

221
12:15.270 --> 12:15.750
Lord Xie.

222
12:15.750 --> 12:17.000
You have to think of a way quickly.

223
12:17.000 --> 12:18.360
-Lord Xie. -Lord Xie.

224
12:18.360 --> 12:20.890
-Do something. -Protect my family, Lord Xie.

225
12:21.510 --> 12:23.630
Yes, Lord Xie, please say something.

226
12:27.390 --> 12:28.360
Lord Xie,

227
12:29.080 --> 12:31.320
are you really not afraid at all?

228
12:35.720 --> 12:37.320
Lord Shen Zhibai

229
12:38.750 --> 12:41.030
was a close friend of mine when he was alive.

230
12:41.030 --> 12:43.440
Since he is the son of an old friend,

231
12:44.030 --> 12:45.960
I can't wait to catch up with him.

232
12:46.670 --> 12:47.870
What is there to fear?

233
12:51.600 --> 12:52.670
It seems

234
12:52.690 --> 12:54.960
Lord Xie has already found a way out.

235
12:56.080 --> 12:57.540
What about the rest of you?

236
12:57.600 --> 13:00.320
I'm afraid it won't be so easy for you.

237
13:01.310 --> 13:02.080
My Lady.

238
13:02.510 --> 13:05.730
My wife also has water transport gangs at the docks.

239
13:06.150 --> 13:07.630
If you want them,

240
13:07.630 --> 13:08.480
I will offer them all.

241
13:08.480 --> 13:10.080
Please save my life.

242
13:10.080 --> 13:10.870
My family has a dock.

243
13:10.870 --> 13:12.630
-I'll surrender it to the Pei family. -Please protect us, My Lady.

244
13:12.630 --> 13:13.960
-My Lady. -Shoo, shoo!

245
13:14.030 --> 13:15.550
We have granaries and rice barns!

246
13:15.550 --> 13:16.150
They are all for the Pei family.

247
13:16.150 --> 13:16.600
Alright.

248
13:16.600 --> 13:16.910
My Lady.

249
13:16.910 --> 13:17.480
Let go.

250
13:17.790 --> 13:18.250
My Lady.

251
13:19.200 --> 13:20.660
I don't have the final say.

252
13:20.670 --> 13:22.460
You need Lord Xie's approval.

253
13:23.200 --> 13:25.120
Lord Xie, please say something.

254
13:26.840 --> 13:28.150
The Pei family

255
13:29.790 --> 13:32.250
manages hundreds of water transport gangs.

256
13:32.630 --> 13:34.630
Back then, one of Lord Shen Zhibai's

257
13:34.910 --> 13:36.270
major crimes

258
13:36.670 --> 13:39.720
was embezzling profits from water transport.

259
13:40.390 --> 13:43.000
Now that Shen Run is investigating things,

260
13:43.200 --> 13:45.630
My Lady, although it has nothing to do with you,

261
13:45.630 --> 13:46.550
I'm afraid

262
13:47.080 --> 13:50.150
the Pei family cannot escape involvement.

263
13:50.960 --> 13:52.150
If I'm not wrong,

264
13:52.480 --> 13:56.960
the Pei family is already caught in Shen Run's schemes.

265
13:58.030 --> 13:58.870
I suggest

266
14:00.270 --> 14:03.530
the Pei family figure out a way to protect yourselves soon.

267
14:04.960 --> 14:06.480
I just said it.

268
14:07.290 --> 14:11.200
Hengtang belongs to everyone,

269
14:11.270 --> 14:14.270
not just me.

270
14:15.150 --> 14:17.210
We can discuss everything together.

271
14:17.480 --> 14:18.770
Besides,

272
14:19.000 --> 14:20.660
the County Lady has returned.

273
14:21.000 --> 14:22.250
She is wise, too.

274
14:22.360 --> 14:23.360
I suggest letting

275
14:23.440 --> 14:27.390
the County Lady take charge of the overall situation.

276
14:27.550 --> 14:28.750
You can all discuss together

277
14:28.750 --> 14:30.580
and do what you want best.

278
14:31.120 --> 14:32.450
I will listen to you all.

279
14:33.840 --> 14:35.360
Don't say that, Lord Xie.

280
14:35.360 --> 14:36.890
Lord Xie, what should we do?

281
14:51.480 --> 14:54.010
What year is this old tea from? It's so bitter.

282
14:55.750 --> 14:56.670
Lord Xie,

283
14:58.200 --> 15:00.870
it's time for something new.

284
15:12.150 --> 15:13.600
Okay.

285
15:14.100 --> 15:17.440
[Distinguished Family]

286
15:16.000 --> 15:16.960
What?

287
15:17.750 --> 15:18.910
Call off the engagement?

288
15:18.910 --> 15:19.600
Yes.

289
15:20.150 --> 15:20.960
Reporting to the Master

290
15:20.960 --> 15:21.820
and Head Madam,

291
15:21.960 --> 15:23.020
the Pei family says

292
15:23.200 --> 15:24.000
the Eldest Lady

293
15:24.000 --> 15:25.360
is cursed to harm her mother and husband,

294
15:25.360 --> 15:28.020
so they sent a notice to call off the engagement.

295
15:30.750 --> 15:31.910
Pei Liangyong

296
15:32.600 --> 15:33.930
is utterly ridiculous.

297
15:35.200 --> 15:36.360
How can marriage

298
15:36.960 --> 15:38.490
be treated as child's play?

299
15:38.550 --> 15:41.150
The three letters and six etiquettes have all been completed.

300
15:41.150 --> 15:43.550
He can't just call it off whenever he wants.

301
15:43.840 --> 15:44.900
Calm down, Master.

302
15:46.480 --> 15:47.740
They just got engaged,

303
15:48.200 --> 15:50.200
and Madam Pei died a tragic death.

304
15:50.510 --> 15:52.320
Presumably, the Founding Count

305
15:52.550 --> 15:53.960
has other thoughts.

306
15:54.720 --> 15:56.600
Maybe he thinks it's bad luck.

307
15:58.360 --> 15:59.390
What did you say?

308
16:01.270 --> 16:02.630
So unruly.

309
16:04.080 --> 16:06.750
The heir of the Founding Count is in mourning.

310
16:08.200 --> 16:09.960
They certainly won't be able to marry

311
16:09.960 --> 16:11.290
within the next 3 years.

312
16:11.910 --> 16:14.320
But Qinghe can't wait that long.

313
16:14.910 --> 16:17.570
Why don't we find her another family?

314
16:26.600 --> 16:27.360
Father.

315
16:27.960 --> 16:29.320
Lanshan and I have an agreement.

316
16:29.320 --> 16:31.670
As soon as his mourning period is over, we will get married.

317
16:31.670 --> 16:33.530
I don't want to marry anyone else.

318
16:35.270 --> 16:36.240
Qinghe.

319
16:37.000 --> 16:38.330
You are not yet married.

320
16:38.390 --> 16:39.840
Although you have an engagement,

321
16:39.840 --> 16:41.140
meeting privately

322
16:41.480 --> 16:43.410
will give people cause for gossip.

323
16:43.440 --> 16:44.240
Exactly.

324
16:44.600 --> 16:46.030
If this gets out one day,

325
16:46.030 --> 16:47.630
people will say the women of the Xie family are unchaste,

326
16:47.630 --> 16:48.960
and that's why the engagement was broken.

327
16:48.960 --> 16:51.090
It'd really disgrace our family name.

328
16:57.790 --> 16:58.550
Mother.

329
16:58.910 --> 17:01.000
This is just an excuse the Pei family made up

330
17:01.000 --> 17:02.660
to break the engagement.

331
17:02.910 --> 17:04.240
Instead of seeking justice,

332
17:04.240 --> 17:06.109
why are we blaming Eldest Sister?

333
17:09.349 --> 17:10.109
Father.

334
17:10.589 --> 17:11.790
I think the Pei family

335
17:11.880 --> 17:13.589
isn't targeting Eldest Sister,

336
17:13.589 --> 17:15.790
but trying to embarrass our Xie family.

337
17:20.680 --> 17:21.720
Qinghe.

338
17:22.069 --> 17:24.130
You really have an unfortunate fate.

339
17:24.310 --> 17:25.829
She should be punished if she deserves it.

340
17:25.829 --> 17:27.690
Don't let our inner court affairs

341
17:28.069 --> 17:30.440
ruin the friendship between the two families.

342
17:30.440 --> 17:31.310
Okay.

343
17:31.310 --> 17:32.110
Stop talking.

344
17:32.550 --> 17:33.950
Everyone, stop talking.

345
17:40.350 --> 17:42.610
I am busy with official duties every day,

346
17:42.830 --> 17:46.160
and I still have to listen to your chattering when I get back.

347
17:46.310 --> 17:48.110
A minister's virtue is loyalty.

348
17:48.240 --> 17:49.970
A son's virtue is filial piety.

349
17:50.110 --> 17:51.160
And a woman's virtue

350
17:51.160 --> 17:52.360
is her wifely duties.

351
17:53.480 --> 17:56.480
I think you have all forgotten them in this residence.

352
17:57.720 --> 17:59.400
Each of you has your own ideas.

353
18:03.680 --> 18:04.590
Wenzhuo,

354
18:04.920 --> 18:06.400
don't let me worry about

355
18:06.400 --> 18:08.400
the matters of the inner household.

356
18:08.440 --> 18:09.770
You make the decisions.

357
18:11.200 --> 18:12.960
If anyone dares to disobey,

358
18:12.960 --> 18:15.490
punish them with family rules without mercy.

359
18:17.160 --> 18:18.000
Yes.

360
18:31.160 --> 18:32.650
Eldest Lady Qinghe

361
18:32.960 --> 18:34.200
has misbehaved

362
18:34.640 --> 18:36.720
and damaged the reputation of the Xie family.

363
18:36.720 --> 18:38.250
She is grounded for 3 months

364
18:38.480 --> 18:39.640
and must copy the Admonitions for Women

365
18:39.640 --> 18:40.570
a hundred times.

366
18:44.270 --> 18:45.160
Qingyuan,

367
18:46.350 --> 18:48.610
if you feel sorry for your eldest sister,

368
18:50.750 --> 18:54.160
kneel in the ancestral hall with her tonight.

369
19:04.960 --> 19:07.360
To think you wanted Father to speak for you.

370
19:07.920 --> 19:09.450
You should realize clearly

371
19:09.790 --> 19:12.250
who is in charge of the Xie's inner household

372
19:12.400 --> 19:14.130
from now on.

373
19:31.550 --> 19:32.440
Eldest Sister.

374
19:33.920 --> 19:34.830
Fourth Sister.

375
19:35.750 --> 19:36.720
I'm sorry.

376
19:37.270 --> 19:38.930
I dragged you into this again.

377
19:40.270 --> 19:41.530
Don't blame yourself.

378
19:42.160 --> 19:42.830
Mother

379
19:42.830 --> 19:45.600
is angry that I asked Third Madam about the past,

380
19:46.030 --> 19:47.790
so she deliberately targeted you.

381
19:47.790 --> 19:49.650
It's me who dragged you into this.

382
19:50.960 --> 19:54.110
What happened between you and Young Master Pei?

383
19:54.510 --> 19:55.270
The day before yesterday,

384
19:55.270 --> 19:57.930
didn't he come to the herbal shop to look for you?

385
19:59.030 --> 20:00.310
I have no idea.

386
20:00.410 --> 20:02.890
[Respectful exchange of birth details] [A match made in heaven]

387
20:00.830 --> 20:01.830
He clearly said

388
20:02.200 --> 20:04.270
he would marry me in 3 years.

389
20:04.270 --> 20:05.830
But it's only been 3 days,

390
20:06.310 --> 20:08.040
and the narrative has changed.

391
20:09.240 --> 20:11.510
Something must be wrong.

392
20:13.240 --> 20:14.480
Don't worry.

393
20:14.640 --> 20:17.270
Something might have happened in the Pei family.

394
20:17.270 --> 20:18.960
I will go to the Pei residence tomorrow

395
20:18.960 --> 20:20.690
and get an explanation for you.

396
20:25.160 --> 20:25.750
Madam.

397
20:26.510 --> 20:29.830
The Pei family sent someone to deliver generous gifts today.

398
20:29.830 --> 20:31.750
They said Fourth Lady

399
20:32.030 --> 20:34.360
went to the Pei family for an explanation,

400
20:34.720 --> 20:37.050
and they came to apologize to Eldest Lady.

401
20:38.720 --> 20:41.270
It's Qingyuan causing trouble again.

402
20:42.790 --> 20:43.850
It doesn't matter.

403
20:45.240 --> 20:49.170
Anyway, this marriage with the Founding Count's residence is ruined.

404
20:49.400 --> 20:50.510
Just keep Qinghe

405
20:51.350 --> 20:52.350
locked up for now.

406
20:53.160 --> 20:54.590
Let the third branch know

407
20:55.160 --> 20:56.890
the rules of the Xie household.

408
20:57.480 --> 20:59.030
Nothing else matters.

409
20:59.920 --> 21:01.320
The most important thing

410
21:03.480 --> 21:05.350
is Zhenglun's funeral.

411
21:06.400 --> 21:07.590
Have you done

412
21:08.590 --> 21:09.720
everything needed?

413
21:10.880 --> 21:12.080
Rest assured, Madam.

414
21:13.000 --> 21:15.640
The belongings of Eldest Young Master just arrived,

415
21:15.640 --> 21:17.370
and I've already checked them.

416
21:17.590 --> 21:18.850
That item is not there.

417
21:20.920 --> 21:21.830
That's good.

418
21:25.400 --> 21:26.440
My Lady.

419
21:27.030 --> 21:28.920
Madam Hu is really too vicious.

420
21:28.920 --> 21:30.200
Even though the Pei family has apologized,

421
21:30.200 --> 21:32.200
she still won't let Eldest Lady out.

422
21:33.640 --> 21:34.700
In this residence,

423
21:35.480 --> 21:37.810
the deaths of Concubine Xia and my mother,

424
21:38.070 --> 21:39.670
and Concubine Mei going mad,

425
21:39.790 --> 21:41.830
were all her doing.

426
21:44.310 --> 21:45.240
Tomorrow

427
21:46.240 --> 21:47.900
is Eldest Brother's funeral.

428
21:49.590 --> 21:51.480
It's time for the guilty

429
21:53.160 --> 21:54.360
to be buried with him.

430
21:58.160 --> 21:59.030
Lord Xie,

431
21:59.350 --> 22:00.090
my condolences.

432
22:00.090 --> 22:01.710
-Xie. -Lord Xie, my condolences.

433
22:01.710 --> 22:02.430
My condolences.

434
22:02.430 --> 22:03.920
Xie, my condolences.

435
22:04.510 --> 22:06.500
Zhenglun died for his nation.

436
22:06.920 --> 22:07.920
The men of Hengtang

437
22:07.920 --> 22:09.350
will never forget this.

438
22:09.350 --> 22:11.080
My brother died for his nation.

439
22:11.270 --> 22:12.710
But at his funeral,

440
22:13.110 --> 22:15.400
even his body couldn't be sent home.

441
22:15.960 --> 22:17.590
The Northern Frontier is far,

442
22:17.590 --> 22:18.790
and the war is raging.

443
22:19.920 --> 22:21.400
They could only gather his clothes

444
22:21.400 --> 22:23.200
and send them back by fast horse.

445
22:24.880 --> 22:26.810
Had I known it was a final farewell,

446
22:27.110 --> 22:28.790
I would have spoken to him

447
22:29.200 --> 22:30.400
much more in the past.

448
22:32.350 --> 22:34.050
Chunzhi insisted on coming,

449
22:34.160 --> 22:35.850
but he is really unwell.

450
22:35.870 --> 22:37.590
I didn't want him to bring any illness

451
22:37.590 --> 22:39.160
to disturb Zhenglun's spirit.

452
22:39.160 --> 22:40.790
Thank you for your thoughtfulness, Madam Li.

453
22:40.790 --> 22:43.790
It is comforting enough that the two of you could come.

454
22:45.590 --> 22:46.830
Ever since you arrived,

455
22:46.830 --> 22:48.590
the Xie family has had no peace.

456
22:48.610 --> 22:50.470
Watch your words, Second Sister.

457
22:51.240 --> 22:52.920
We're at Eldest Brother's funeral.

458
22:52.920 --> 22:54.980
How can you say such baseless things?

459
22:55.890 --> 22:56.960
How is it baseless?

460
22:58.030 --> 22:58.960
Qingru,

461
22:59.550 --> 23:00.750
stop making a scene.

462
23:07.510 --> 23:10.070
Yongjia County Lady has arrived!

463
23:12.200 --> 23:13.200
My Lady.

464
23:13.200 --> 23:16.200
Apologies for not welcoming you.

465
23:16.200 --> 23:17.730
Greetings, My Lady.

466
23:24.960 --> 23:25.880
Lord Xie.

467
23:26.680 --> 23:28.070
It's getting late.

468
23:28.680 --> 23:29.680
You should begin.

469
23:39.000 --> 23:39.880
Master,

470
23:41.070 --> 23:42.960
shall we begin?

471
23:46.160 --> 23:47.240
My Xie family

472
23:47.830 --> 23:49.720
is a family that upholds loyalty, valor,

473
23:49.720 --> 23:51.650
filial piety, and righteousness.

474
23:52.160 --> 23:53.680
My eldest son, Zhenglun,

475
23:54.310 --> 23:56.170
dedicated himself to the nation,

476
23:56.200 --> 23:58.200
protecting our land and our people.

477
23:58.640 --> 23:59.840
In his final moments,

478
24:00.400 --> 24:01.880
he fought bravely against the enemy,

479
24:01.880 --> 24:03.750
dyeing his battle robes with blood.

480
24:03.750 --> 24:04.790
He has brought

481
24:05.000 --> 24:07.680
honor to the ancestors of the Xie family.

482
24:08.000 --> 24:08.720
Today,

483
24:08.830 --> 24:10.640
I lead the entire Xie family

484
24:11.160 --> 24:13.590
to respectfully welcome the general's armor

485
24:13.590 --> 24:14.440
back home.

486
24:16.640 --> 24:19.240
The general's armor is returning for burial!

487
25:05.720 --> 25:06.750
There seems to be

488
25:06.960 --> 25:08.640
a letter within the armor.

489
25:08.520 --> 25:10.020
[Respectfully to Brother Zhenglun, from younger brother Zhengjun]

490
25:13.590 --> 25:15.520
Did this belong to Eldest Brother?

491
25:16.240 --> 25:17.440
Since it was his belonging,

492
25:17.440 --> 25:19.500
let's burn it together for Zhenglun.

493
25:19.790 --> 25:20.480
Nanny Liu.

494
25:20.500 --> 25:21.090
Yes.

495
25:22.480 --> 25:23.030
No!

496
25:23.030 --> 25:23.760
Out of my way!

497
25:25.030 --> 25:27.760
I want to know what my brother said before he died.

498
25:28.750 --> 25:29.850
This letter

499
25:29.960 --> 25:31.660
appearing here suddenly

500
25:31.830 --> 25:32.830
must mean that Eldest Brother

501
25:32.830 --> 25:34.830
still has some unfulfilled wishes.

502
25:39.200 --> 25:40.110
Thank you both.

503
25:40.790 --> 25:42.650
It's our duty to avenge the heroic

504
25:42.720 --> 25:44.400
and redress any grievances.

505
25:45.030 --> 25:45.510
Go.

506
25:46.030 --> 25:47.200
Expose that evil woman's true colors

507
25:47.200 --> 25:48.730
in front of all of Hengtang.

508
25:48.920 --> 25:50.580
We will support you from here.

509
25:50.590 --> 25:51.830
There is one more thing

510
25:51.830 --> 25:53.030
I need your help with.

511
25:53.510 --> 25:54.200
Tell us.

512
25:55.160 --> 25:57.070
At my eldest brother's funeral tomorrow,

513
25:57.070 --> 25:57.920
this letter

514
25:58.240 --> 26:00.270
must appear among his belongings.

515
26:05.590 --> 26:06.640
Leave it to us.

516
26:07.000 --> 26:10.500
[Respectfully to Brother Zhenglun, from younger brother Zhengjun]

517
26:48.400 --> 26:49.070
Zhengjun.

518
26:49.510 --> 26:51.480
The sudden appearance of this letter

519
26:51.480 --> 26:52.740
is highly suspicious.

520
26:53.200 --> 26:55.830
Today is your eldest brother's funeral.

521
26:57.240 --> 26:58.840
We must not lose our manners.

522
26:59.720 --> 27:00.650
Come down first.

523
27:05.920 --> 27:07.520
To my dear brother Zhenglun.

524
27:07.880 --> 27:10.670
Mother has been ill at the estate for a long time.

525
27:11.350 --> 27:12.310
The doctor said

526
27:12.790 --> 27:14.390
her condition is incurable.

527
27:14.550 --> 27:15.200
Zhengjun!

528
27:15.830 --> 27:17.200
This is the mourning hall.

529
27:17.200 --> 27:18.720
We cannot afford any complications.

530
27:18.720 --> 27:19.450
Listen to me.

531
27:19.830 --> 27:20.430
Come down.

532
27:23.790 --> 27:24.480
Father.

533
27:26.440 --> 27:27.200
Master.

534
27:28.790 --> 27:30.120
This is a family letter,

535
27:30.830 --> 27:31.950
not his last words.

536
27:32.590 --> 27:34.920
It is not suitable to be read here.

537
27:39.270 --> 27:40.310
My wife is right.

538
27:40.750 --> 27:42.340
This is a family letter.

539
27:42.480 --> 27:44.550
Don't read it in public.

540
27:45.030 --> 27:45.720
Come down.

541
27:46.550 --> 27:48.640
Mother probably doesn't have much time left.

542
27:48.640 --> 27:49.240
Zhengjun!

543
27:49.350 --> 27:50.590
She resents you in the end

544
27:50.590 --> 27:51.830
for abandoning her while she's seriously ill

545
27:51.830 --> 27:53.510
to go to the battlefield.

546
27:53.510 --> 27:55.920
You sacrificed your family for the greater good.

547
27:55.920 --> 27:57.500
You failed to repay her,

548
27:57.590 --> 27:59.050
which makes you unfilial.

549
27:59.270 --> 28:00.930
As Mother lay on her deathbed,

550
28:01.240 --> 28:03.480
I hope for your swift victory and return.

551
28:03.480 --> 28:05.750
If she cannot see you one last time,

552
28:05.960 --> 28:07.770
I fear she will not rest in peace

553
28:08.070 --> 28:10.000
and will die with resentment.

554
28:12.750 --> 28:13.590
This is...

555
28:14.160 --> 28:15.270
A huge taboo on the battlefield.

556
28:15.270 --> 28:16.070
That's right.

557
28:16.510 --> 28:18.640
The slightest negligence can cost a life.

558
28:18.640 --> 28:20.510
That's why letters to the border

559
28:20.510 --> 28:22.200
have always reported only good news.

560
28:22.200 --> 28:23.790
Who would write such a letter to the frontline?

561
28:23.790 --> 28:24.480
Exactly.

562
28:24.480 --> 28:25.680
In that case,

563
28:26.200 --> 28:27.440
Zhenglun must have died in battle

564
28:27.440 --> 28:29.310
because he was eager to finish things

565
28:29.310 --> 28:31.750
and rush back to see his mother one last time.

566
28:31.750 --> 28:32.610
Makes sense.

567
28:32.640 --> 28:33.400
Makes sense.

568
28:33.400 --> 28:34.400
That makes sense.

569
28:38.750 --> 28:39.440
Zhengjun.

570
28:40.440 --> 28:41.700
Who wrote this letter?

571
28:45.000 --> 28:45.790
Respectfully yours,

572
28:45.790 --> 28:47.320
younger brother Zhengjun.

573
28:51.680 --> 28:52.410
It wasn't me.

574
28:53.680 --> 28:54.590
It wasn't me!

575
28:54.960 --> 28:55.750
I clearly...

576
28:56.480 --> 28:57.830
I clearly wrote,

577
28:58.000 --> 28:59.540
"Mother is in good health,

578
28:59.680 --> 29:01.200
and I am studying diligently

579
29:01.200 --> 29:02.440
without slacking off."

580
29:02.440 --> 29:03.570
How did this happen?

581
29:03.590 --> 29:04.590
Fourth Sister,

582
29:05.200 --> 29:06.930
we wrote this letter together.

583
29:07.310 --> 29:08.590
How did this happen?

584
29:12.110 --> 29:12.900
I'm afraid

585
29:13.400 --> 29:14.730
the letter was swapped.

586
29:17.440 --> 29:18.240
You're right.

587
29:19.030 --> 29:21.160
Someone must have swapped the letter.

588
29:21.160 --> 29:22.160
Someone must have!

589
29:22.160 --> 29:22.750
Father.

590
29:23.160 --> 29:24.000
Grandmother.

591
29:24.200 --> 29:25.690
My brother was murdered.

592
29:25.760 --> 29:27.570
He was killed by this letter!

593
29:29.830 --> 29:30.590
Shu.

594
29:30.880 --> 29:31.240
Here.

595
29:34.720 --> 29:36.520
Let's finish the funeral first.

596
29:36.720 --> 29:37.780
As for this matter,

597
29:38.400 --> 29:40.260
we will discuss it when we go back.

598
29:43.070 --> 29:43.680
Yes.

599
29:45.720 --> 29:46.320
Come down.

600
29:46.400 --> 29:47.200
No!

601
29:48.240 --> 29:50.200
I must clarify it here.

602
29:51.200 --> 29:52.070
Second Brother,

603
29:52.070 --> 29:54.200
who did you give the letter to that day?

604
30:04.880 --> 30:05.930
Tell me.

605
30:06.470 --> 30:09.270
Where did you take the letter after I passed it to you?

606
30:09.270 --> 30:10.480
I...

607
30:10.590 --> 30:11.400
Speak!

608
30:11.790 --> 30:12.640
Yes.

609
30:13.480 --> 30:15.940
The Second Young Master indeed gave it to me.

610
30:32.790 --> 30:33.400
Yes,

611
30:34.000 --> 30:35.660
I was the one who sent Nanny Liu

612
30:35.830 --> 30:36.890
to take the letter.

613
30:37.350 --> 30:38.560
I wanted to help

614
30:38.680 --> 30:39.810
send it out quickly.

615
30:40.200 --> 30:41.260
But after Nanny Liu

616
30:41.590 --> 30:43.060
got the letter,

617
30:43.200 --> 30:43.980
the rain

618
30:44.240 --> 30:45.990
had completely soaked it.

619
30:46.540 --> 30:48.270
Not a single word could be read.

620
30:48.510 --> 30:49.540
I guessed

621
30:49.590 --> 30:52.160
Zhengjun must have wanted to report the family affairs

622
30:52.160 --> 30:53.110
to Zhenglun,

623
30:53.550 --> 30:56.160
so I had someone draft one.

624
30:59.160 --> 31:00.720
I meant well.

625
31:00.830 --> 31:01.590
You...

626
31:02.440 --> 31:03.400
You meant well?

627
31:04.270 --> 31:06.750
If you meant well, you should have said it clearly to my face!

628
31:06.750 --> 31:07.410
I really...

629
31:07.640 --> 31:09.240
I didn't expect the Head Madam of the Xie family

630
31:09.240 --> 31:10.840
to do something like this.

631
31:11.110 --> 31:14.040
It's no different from murdering a concubine's son.

632
31:14.080 --> 31:15.110
Keep your voice down.

633
31:15.110 --> 31:16.510
Don't talk nonsense!

634
31:17.440 --> 31:19.100
What Mother said is also true.

635
31:19.680 --> 31:22.030
At that time, Mei Yinghua was about to die.

636
31:22.550 --> 31:23.270
Mother

637
31:23.720 --> 31:25.440
definitely didn't do it on purpose.

638
31:25.440 --> 31:26.030
Father,

639
31:26.510 --> 31:27.680
there must be something wrong with this matter.

640
31:27.680 --> 31:29.940
Don't be provoked by false accusations.

641
31:37.510 --> 31:38.030
Father,

642
31:38.750 --> 31:40.270
my brother hasn't been buried yet.

643
31:40.270 --> 31:42.330
This matter can't just end like this.

644
31:50.110 --> 31:50.790
Father,

645
31:51.350 --> 31:52.240
Zhenglun

646
31:52.550 --> 31:54.880
was not only the eldest son of the Xie family

647
31:54.880 --> 31:57.090
and our respected eldest brother,

648
31:57.350 --> 31:58.510
but also a loyal martyr

649
31:58.510 --> 32:00.420
known to everyone in Hengtang.

650
32:00.720 --> 32:02.920
This is not as simple as a family affair.

651
32:05.880 --> 32:07.280
The people who came today

652
32:07.480 --> 32:09.420
are all distinguished guests.

653
32:09.550 --> 32:11.610
If we don't give them an explanation,

654
32:11.750 --> 32:14.310
how can we demonstrate the righteousness of our Xie family?

655
32:14.310 --> 32:16.110
How will we convince the public?

656
32:16.270 --> 32:17.030
Father.

657
32:20.270 --> 32:21.350
Eldest Lady is right.

658
32:21.350 --> 32:23.750
A loyal and heroic soul has died,

659
32:23.750 --> 32:25.270
yet the cause of death is suspicious.

660
32:25.270 --> 32:26.680
If it's not thoroughly investigated,

661
32:26.680 --> 32:28.410
how can we possibly sit idly by?

662
32:28.510 --> 32:30.070
Indeed!

663
32:30.070 --> 32:30.830
Mother,

664
32:31.070 --> 32:32.790
you have known me for decades.

665
32:32.790 --> 32:34.160
You know very well

666
32:34.160 --> 32:35.700
how I treat the Xie family.

667
32:36.440 --> 32:37.520
I am a daughter

668
32:38.310 --> 32:39.830
of the prominent Hu family.

669
32:39.830 --> 32:41.030
You also know

670
32:41.030 --> 32:42.490
what my character is like.

671
32:43.110 --> 32:45.110
Old Madam, please discern the truth

672
32:45.270 --> 32:46.840
and uphold justice for me.

673
32:51.680 --> 32:52.280
Mother...

674
32:55.160 --> 32:56.880
Exactly. How can it not be investigated?

675
32:56.880 --> 32:57.960
The evidence is here.

676
32:57.960 --> 32:59.000
How can we not investigate?

677
32:59.000 --> 32:59.720
Enough!

678
33:14.350 --> 33:15.200
Everyone.

679
33:16.000 --> 33:17.680
Today's funeral

680
33:18.720 --> 33:20.480
is to mourn Zhenglun,

681
33:20.750 --> 33:22.680
who sacrificed his life for the nation.

682
33:22.680 --> 33:24.540
May his heroic soul live forever.

683
33:24.880 --> 33:27.310
If there are hidden circumstances...

684
33:27.830 --> 33:29.960
after the Xie family investigates it,

685
33:30.070 --> 33:31.930
we will definitely give everyone

686
33:32.110 --> 33:33.110
an explanation.

687
33:51.880 --> 33:52.720
Everyone.

688
33:53.960 --> 33:55.310
The general's armor

689
33:55.680 --> 33:57.800
will be placed in the ancestral hall.

690
33:58.720 --> 33:59.880
When his remains

691
34:00.350 --> 34:01.720
are brought back in the future,

692
34:01.720 --> 34:03.160
they will be buried together.

693
34:03.160 --> 34:04.820
Today's matter is concluded.

694
34:05.070 --> 34:07.000
Please return to your residences.

695
34:07.070 --> 34:08.070
This...

696
34:11.400 --> 34:12.000
Yes.

697
34:15.000 --> 34:18.280
Lord Shen, Commander of the Palace Guard, has arrived.

698
34:50.670 --> 34:51.800
Yan Rui?

699
34:51.800 --> 34:53.110
It's Yan Rui.

700
34:54.480 --> 34:55.210
It's Yan Rui.

701
34:55.280 --> 34:57.080
Didn't they say it was Lord Shen?

702
35:01.360 --> 35:02.070
Yan Rui?

703
35:02.800 --> 35:04.550
How dare he come to the Xie family?

704
35:04.550 --> 35:06.750
And he chose to come during the funeral.

705
35:36.710 --> 35:38.400
Commander of the Palace Guard,

706
35:38.400 --> 35:39.410
Shen Run,

707
35:39.800 --> 35:41.200
here to comfort the heroic spirit.

708
35:41.200 --> 35:42.370
I apologize for

709
35:42.400 --> 35:43.730
disturbing your peace.

710
35:43.800 --> 35:44.660
My dear friend,

711
35:44.880 --> 35:46.010
have a safe journey.

712
35:52.960 --> 35:54.490
The imperial edict is here.

713
36:05.670 --> 36:07.400
I heard that a family of martyrs

714
36:07.400 --> 36:09.000
will inherit the righteous spirit of heaven and earth.

715
36:07.680 --> 36:10.270
[Commander of the Palace Guard, Shen Run]

716
36:09.190 --> 36:11.190
As such, Zhenglun of the Xie family

717
36:11.440 --> 36:13.280
was endowed with a resolute posture

718
36:13.280 --> 36:14.800
and the courage of a defender.

719
36:14.800 --> 36:16.070
Armed and armored,

720
36:16.230 --> 36:17.670
he sacrificed himself in battle.

721
36:17.670 --> 36:18.920
He is hereby posthumously awarded

722
36:18.920 --> 36:20.320
the title of Commandant of Loyalty and Power.

723
36:20.320 --> 36:22.670
He shall be enshrined in the Martyrs' Shrine of the prefecture,

724
36:22.670 --> 36:24.880
and bestowed rites in spring and autumn.

725
36:24.880 --> 36:26.670
His family shall be granted a hundred taels of gold

726
36:26.670 --> 36:27.930
and fifty bolts of silk

727
36:28.000 --> 36:29.440
to compensate the kins left behind.

728
36:29.440 --> 36:30.570
His father, Xie Shu,

729
36:30.760 --> 36:32.020
has taught his son well

730
36:32.070 --> 36:33.510
for instilling loyalty and integrity.

731
36:33.510 --> 36:35.080
He shall be granted the title of Earl of Zhongyong

732
36:35.080 --> 36:37.670
and promoted to Grand Officer of the Secondary First Rank

733
36:37.670 --> 36:39.630
to commend his family's teachings.

734
36:39.630 --> 36:42.510
A plaque honoring the loyal Xie family shall be built to perpetuate

735
36:42.510 --> 36:44.110
their renown for posterity.

736
36:49.070 --> 36:50.110
Lord Xie,

737
36:52.230 --> 36:53.690
please receive the edict.

738
36:54.880 --> 36:55.630
I humbly

739
36:55.800 --> 36:56.860
receive the edict.

740
37:02.880 --> 37:04.360
I, Xie Shu,

741
37:04.480 --> 37:06.810
thank His Majesty for the profound grace.

742
37:23.190 --> 37:24.050
My dear nephew,

743
37:24.630 --> 37:25.800
I didn't expect

744
37:26.230 --> 37:28.030
you to be the son of an old friend.

745
37:28.190 --> 37:29.280
Your father,

746
37:29.280 --> 37:30.840
Lord Shen Zhibai,

747
37:31.030 --> 37:33.870
was my best friend.

748
37:34.030 --> 37:36.510
Do not be in a hurry to exchange pleasantries with me, Your Lordship.

749
37:36.510 --> 37:38.670
I have a second edict to read.

750
37:44.070 --> 37:44.920
Shen Che.

751
37:47.880 --> 37:49.440
In the 39th year of the Jingyu era,

752
37:49.440 --> 37:51.710
Shen Zhibai took office in Hengtang,

753
37:52.070 --> 37:54.670
and broke the monopoly of the prominent families.

754
37:54.670 --> 37:57.510
He found out that they colluded with the authorities

755
37:57.510 --> 37:59.400
under the guise of the Green Sprouts Law,

756
37:59.400 --> 38:00.760
forcing the civilians

757
38:00.760 --> 38:02.030
into high-interest loans

758
38:02.030 --> 38:03.550
and turning the imperial court's benevolent policy

759
38:03.550 --> 38:04.710
into a vicious law.

760
38:04.960 --> 38:05.840
From then on,

761
38:05.840 --> 38:09.360
Shen Zhibai cracked down on the collusion between officials and merchants.

762
38:09.360 --> 38:11.110
For a while, the politics were clean,

763
38:11.110 --> 38:12.770
and the people lived in peace.

764
38:14.030 --> 38:14.880
However,

765
38:15.480 --> 38:16.960
in less than a year,

766
38:17.230 --> 38:18.920
the prominent families colluded with the officials,

767
38:18.920 --> 38:20.550
instigated the merchant guilds,

768
38:20.550 --> 38:21.800
and united

769
38:21.800 --> 38:24.000
to fabricate serious charges of corruption

770
38:24.000 --> 38:25.670
against Shen Zhibai,

771
38:25.800 --> 38:27.550
framing him collectively.

772
38:27.880 --> 38:29.190
Overnight,

773
38:29.280 --> 38:30.670
Shen Zhibai

774
38:30.920 --> 38:33.670
went from a peerlessly honest and loyal official

775
38:33.960 --> 38:36.240
to a world-shocking

776
38:36.400 --> 38:38.190
corrupt official in Hengtang.

777
38:47.550 --> 38:49.810
Back then, the Shen family was executed,

778
38:50.510 --> 38:52.280
and only two children

779
38:52.880 --> 38:55.360
narrowly escaped death.

780
38:55.960 --> 38:56.920
From then on,

781
38:57.960 --> 39:00.820
they became lonely wandering ghosts in this world.

782
39:09.840 --> 39:10.630
I am

783
39:11.510 --> 39:12.510
Shen Run,

784
39:14.960 --> 39:16.510
son of Shen Zhibai.

785
39:17.400 --> 39:19.030
By the Emperor's edict,

786
39:21.070 --> 39:23.070
I am here to clear Shen Zhibai's name

787
39:23.480 --> 39:26.140
and purge the heinous criminals from back then.

788
39:27.110 --> 39:28.420
From today on,

789
39:28.590 --> 39:30.590
regardless of their official rank,

790
39:30.670 --> 39:32.600
anyone with evidence against them

791
39:33.480 --> 39:34.540
will be handed over

792
39:35.070 --> 39:37.590
to the Palace Guards to be punished according to the law.

793
39:37.590 --> 39:38.990
Those who disobey orders

794
39:39.960 --> 39:41.190
or cause trouble

795
39:41.840 --> 39:43.570
will be executed immediately.

796
39:54.150 --> 39:55.280
I don't accept this!

797
39:56.280 --> 39:57.670
What does a case from years ago

798
39:57.670 --> 39:58.670
have to do with me?

799
39:59.110 --> 40:00.510
Open your damn eyes.

800
40:02.880 --> 40:05.480
I am the eldest son of the Lin family in Hengtang!

801
40:05.480 --> 40:06.230
Do you know

802
40:07.070 --> 40:08.000
who my father...

803
40:14.440 --> 40:15.800
Lin Bingcheng.

804
40:16.310 --> 40:17.870
In the 5th year of Jingxi,

805
40:18.190 --> 40:20.880
he forcibly seized a civilian woman and caused her death.

806
40:20.880 --> 40:22.280
In the 7th year of Jingxi,

807
40:22.630 --> 40:25.090
he allowed his servants to commit violence,

808
40:25.280 --> 40:28.280
forcing dozens of farmers to sell their fertile land.

809
40:28.440 --> 40:30.040
The evidence is conclusive.

810
40:30.590 --> 40:31.850
Execute immediately.

811
40:46.880 --> 40:47.630
Shen Run!

812
40:48.150 --> 40:49.510
You set up a private court

813
40:49.510 --> 40:50.590
and killed the innocent!

814
40:50.590 --> 40:51.670
I will go to the Emperor

815
40:51.670 --> 40:52.590
and report you!

816
40:53.880 --> 40:55.320
I almost forgot.

817
40:55.630 --> 40:57.230
You also allowed

818
41:00.800 --> 41:02.730
your servants to commit violence.

819
41:10.800 --> 41:11.880
And you,

820
41:12.320 --> 41:13.630
Fang Ruike.

821
41:16.510 --> 41:17.280
Not me.

822
41:18.590 --> 41:19.510
Really, not me!

823
41:24.150 --> 41:25.280
Not me!

824
41:28.230 --> 41:30.260
Lord Xie, save me!
